silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_24_rosetta_stone_cross_domain_sections_03_storage_architect_entry_point_concrete_anchor_0#chunkapex_f11 silm:hasLongDescription "The ChunkApex_F11 is the canonical granite chunk: SHA-256 hash 0xF11A... addressing the body-region storage for the vet records for Mittens; both the direct reference and the index-mediated reference resolve here. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'ChunkApex_F11', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
